# 5. Reference Implementation

## Purpose

This section identifies the official reference implementation of the Objective Template.

Rather than maintaining a fictional example, the AVIA repository uses approved System Objectives as the authoritative examples of template application.

---

## Reference Policy

The first approved System Objective created using this template shall become the baseline reference implementation.

Subsequent objectives shall follow the same approved structure while preserving their own engineering content.

---

## Engineering Note

Using a real System Objective as the reference implementation ensures that repository examples remain accurate, current, and governed by the same engineering standards as every other objective document.
